  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "What is the value of the expression \\[ \\begin{aligned} &\\frac1{\\log_2 100!}+\\frac1{\\log_3 100!}\\\\ &\\quad+\\frac1{\\log_4 100!}+\\cdots\\\\ &\\qquad+\\frac1{\\log_{100}100!}? \\end{aligned} \\]",
